        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Values are based and adapted on a different technology (lorries-manufacture).\n\n# Included processes\nThe inventory takes into account the use of resources and the amount of emissions during the production, the maintenance and repair and the disposal of general agricultural machinery. Not taken into account were the impacts caused by fuel consumption during operation-time of the trailing machinery. No data was available about buildings needed for manufacture and maintenance of the machinery. The routes needed for transport from manufacturer place to the farm and from here to disposal place of the waste, are balanced in the utilised transport modules.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
